    <summary>
            Static registry of trigger operations for the Trello connector that have typed payloads.
            Maps operation names to their typed <see cref="T:Azure.Connectors.Sdk.TriggerCallbackPayload`1" /> subtypes.
            Triggers that return binary content (e.g., file downloads) are not included here
            because they have no JSON-deserializable payload type. See <see cref="T:Azure.Connectors.Sdk.Trello.TrelloTriggerOperations" />
            for the complete list of trigger operation name constants.
